AltoERC4626RatioChainlinkOracle::getPrice()
├── when ratio is zero
│   └── it should return zero
├── when ratio is within max allowed growth
│   ├── it should return price in chainlinkNode.outDecimals
│   ├── it should apply ERC4626 ratio conversion correctly
│   └── it should apply chainlink node conversion correctly
└── when ratio exceeds max allowed growth
    ├── it should cap ratio to max allowed growth
    ├── it should return price in chainlinkNode.outDecimals
    └── it should apply chainlink node conversion correctly

